# Files that are part of the repo but must not be served from readysetink.com.
# The whole repo root is otherwise public: internal notes, build scripts, test
# files and database schemas were all fetchable by URL. robots.txt can't hide
# files; leaving them out of the deploy does.
#
# NOT listed on purpose: glossary.md, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md (attribution), agent-gate/ (a future middleware.js imports it at build
# time), *.json data files, forms/, newbuilder/, tournament/ (the app loads them).

# Internal docs and per-developer notes
# Root-level markdown: listed by name so the public glossary.md stays served.
